Package: edifier-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Oleksandr Yarmoliuk <sashayarmolyk@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-dbusmenu-glib-0.4, bluez
Recommends: pipewire-bin, wireplumber, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Control Edifier W820NB Plus (2025) headphones from Linux
 Switch noise cancelling (ANC high or medium, wind, ambient with a level),
 the sound mode (game, music, spatial), the equaliser preset and the A2DP
 codec (LDAC, SBC-XQ, SBC), and read the battery level and firmware version.
 .
 Includes a command line tool and a GTK4 window with a top-bar icon that has the same menu.
 The interface is available in English and Ukrainian; more languages can be
 added as JSON files.
 .
 Only the Edifier W820NB Plus (2025) is supported: other models use other
 protocols.
